{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40108,"sections":[{"id":"script-20108","name":"原始脚本 20108","scripts":[20108],"start":0,"count":19}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:0","scriptId":20108,"text":"清理掉了那些奇怪的粘土怪物之后，波西娅的身影终于变得清晰了一点，夹杂着噪音的声音也恢复了一些。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:1","scriptId":20108,"text":"“恩，干得不错，值得称赞。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:2","scriptId":20108,"text":"“这点程度不算什么，只不过在初期摸索敌人的攻击方式时耽误了点时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":644,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:3","scriptId":20108,"text":"“把那些小东西炸掉真是可惜，能当宠物养就好了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":644,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:4","scriptId":20108,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":644,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":28,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:5","scriptId":20108,"text":"“如果你真得打算这么做的话，以后每天的甜点就没你的份了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":28,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:6","scriptId":20108,"text":"“啊，那我还是选择甜点……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":28,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:7","scriptId":20108,"text":"接着波西娅把事情的原委告诉了艾莉丝她们。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":28,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:8","scriptId":20108,"text":"“就是说有不明的病毒入侵？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:9","scriptId":20108,"text":"“恩……虽然你们处理掉了不少，但是还有一个主要的存活着，接下来你们的任务就是把她处理掉。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:10","scriptId":20108,"text":"波西娅一抬手，她的右边生成了一个人形生物的影像。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":55,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:11","scriptId":20108,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":55,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:12","scriptId":20108,"text":"“这是病毒的主要首脑？这不是之前报告里提到的不明人形么……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":55,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:13","scriptId":20108,"text":"“哦，原来你知道啊～那就没什么了，干掉她就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:14","scriptId":20108,"text":"“说得轻巧，我要追加报酬。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:15","scriptId":20108,"text":"“没问题～钱能解决的问题的对我来说都不是问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:16","scriptId":20108,"text":"（该死的土豪……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:17","scriptId":20108,"text":"“那么就一言为定！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20108:20108:18","scriptId":20108,"text":"“好的，那么我就传送咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
